GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ oauthToken("sample-short") }}

::: post
test("oauthToken() puts the profile's token in the header", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().user).toBe("demo");
});

::: docs
No auth section: the token of `sample-short` goes in a header written by hand, through the
`oauthToken()` template function.
